    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d329">

                <pb facs="0344" n="320" sameAs="frus:frus1864p4/pg320"/>

                <head>[Telegram.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Liverpool,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-10-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 12—3 p. m</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Screw steamer Laurel, 269 tons, one funnel, two masts, sailed from Liverpool on
                    Sunday, with Captain Semmes, a number of guns, ten officers, and one hundred
                    men, supposed for some other vessel. Advise consuls at Madeira, &amp;c., and
                    naval officers.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CONSUL LIVERPOOL.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">American Minister</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
